Package: RLdrop
Title: Direct Dropbox API Access via httr
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R:
    person("Roger", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "your@email.com")
Description: Provides functions to upload, download, list, search, compare,
    copy, move, delete and manage files and folders directly via the Dropbox API
    v2, bypassing the Dropbox desktop client sync queue. Authentication is
    handled via OAuth2 refresh tokens for unattended use. Useful for
    on-demand access to specific files without waiting for the client to
    synchronise.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
